fline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199105397034/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 1358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1358, "last_played": 1663347850, "avatar": "994fd3bb206783794ed03511a3d456110dc5858c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Probably the best experience of playing as a genetically modified super-soldier from the far future ever!", "timestamp_created": 1682078778, "timestamp_updated": 1699216342, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.381085366010665894", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "136984812", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047364094", "personaname": "4_Twomp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198047364094/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 482, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 473, "last_played": 1706471351, "avatar": "9b91dcf58b9012f0d1e2b31b10c1c15d7e7f5250"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a fun game, i played it on PS3 but of course PC is a more smooth experience. The campaign is long enough and has a decent variety of 40k appropriate enemies and a pretty solid amount of lore friendly weapons. The combat is fairly simple but in a fun way. The only downside IMO is you sometimes find yourself trudging around bland environments. Overall this game scratches the itch for a beat em up style Space Marine power fantasy. You will most likely enjoy blasting and cutting down the enemies of the Emperor! Simple verdict: 8/10 maybe 8.5\n\nI think i remember buying this for closer to $20 but that was long beofre the hype of Space Marine 2...", "timestamp_created": 1681956544, "timestamp_updated": 1681956544, "voted_up": true, "votes